@scriptingstudio, good find;  it's the use of `@(....)` that makes the difference here - the inner `(...)` are only needed in order to pass the value of the `$obj` assignment _through_.

In other words: it's only when calling `.ForEach()` on a _scalar_ `[pscustomobject]` instance that the bug surfaces.
It works fine on an _array_ of `[pscustomobject]` instances.

